<P>
	<span id="Pricing1_Label1" class="centerItemHeader">Hosting Services Pricing Options</span><BR>
	&nbsp;<BR>
	While the hosting services can be used for free for as long as you&nbsp;like, 
	you also have the option to register your site.&nbsp;&nbsp;When you 
	register,&nbsp;advertisements will disappear from your site, giving 
	you&nbsp;more control over the look of your pages.&nbsp; In addition, content 
	limits&nbsp;are removed, so you&nbsp;can have as many events and replies to 
	topics as your&nbsp;guild requires.&nbsp;&nbsp;Finally, some themes and 
	functionality of the Community Control Panel are limited to subscriber sites 
	only.
</P>
<P></P>
<P><STRONG>
		<span id="Pricing1_Label2" class="centerItemSubTitle">Pricing Options</span></STRONG></P>
<P>
	<TABLE id="Table1" cellSpacing="1" cellPadding="1" width="100%" border="0" class="baseContentArea">
		<TR>
			<TD><B>Type of Subscription</B></TD>
			<TD><B>Price Every 6 Months</B></TD>
		</TR>
		<TR>
			<TD>Standard Subscription</TD>
			<TD>$30</TD>
		</TR>
		<TR>
			<TD>Subscription+</TD>
			<TD>$45</TD>
		</TR>
	</TABLE>
</P>
<P>The Subscription+ is like the Standard Subscription, except you get a sub-domain 
	with it.&nbsp; For example, instead of the URL to your site being 
	http://www.guildportal.com/Guild.aspx?GuildID=####, you can have a URL like 
	http://yourguildname.guildportal.com.&nbsp;
</P>
<P>These prices are fixed, which means <STRONG>you won't see any additional charges</STRONG>
	for bandwidth or database space that your site occupies.&nbsp;</P>
<BR>
